/IF RESP=1 ("YES"), TYPE "!",THEN
/TAKE KEYBOARD FEEDBACK: " "
/IF CORRECT, ANY KEY IF INCORRECT;
/NO CHANGE IN EXPOSURE CONDITION IF 
/"YES" WAS INCORRECT. IF RESP=0, TYPES
/TWO BLANKS (NOTHING FURTHER ENTERED).
	TAD C240
	JMS I TIPE	/BLANK
	TAD RESP
	TAD C240
	JMS I TIPE	/" " OR "!"
	TAD RESP
	SNA CLA
	JMP NORESP
	KCC
	KSF
	JMP .-1
	KRB		/READ CHAR
